in `docs/ATTRIBUTION-DSS.md` for anyone publishing images obtained through it.

Kept out of LICENSE deliberately: GitHub detects a licence by matching the
file against known texts, and anything appended makes it unrecognisable —
the repository showed NOASSERTION instead of MIT until this was split out.
